flowchart LR
  Q([Question]):::io --> V[Vector search<br/>by meaning]:::store
  Q --> K[BM25 search<br/>by exact terms]:::store
  V --> F[Fuse rankings<br/>RRF]:::step
  K --> F
  F --> CH[Small chunks<br/>matched]:::step
  CH --> PD[Return the<br/>parent section]:::step
  PD --> G[LLM]:::llm --> A([Answer]):::io

  classDef io fill:#E8A33D,stroke:#E8A33D,color:#0B3C49,font-weight:bold
  classDef store fill:#1B7F8C,stroke:#1B7F8C,color:#FFFFFF
  classDef llm fill:#0B3C49,stroke:#0B3C49,color:#FFFFFF,font-weight:bold
  classDef decide fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#C8553D,stroke-width:3px,color:#0B3C49
  classDef step fill:#EEF5F6,stroke:#1B7F8C,color:#0B3C49
